{"language":"en","values":[["/names/cn","罗兰"],["/names/en","Rolan"],["/description_i18n/cn","耀光帝国的初代国王，指挥作战提振士气，能在战斗中为友军提供强力支援。"],["/description_i18n/en","The first king of the Lightbearer Empire, a commanding Support who rallies his allies in battle."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","全军拔剑，随我冲锋。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Draw your blades! Forward, with me!"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","我就勉为其难再当一次英雄吧。"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Very well. I'll play the hero once more."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","长夜已尽，随我迎接破晓。"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Let us greet the dawn!"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/cn","王冠，真是沉重啊。"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","The crown is heavy."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/cn","荣耀归于艾雅。"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","Glory to Jera."],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_i18n/cn","“权力的象征，从来都不在权杖之上。”。"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_i18n/en","Power has never truly resided in the scepter."],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","嗯，舒服，不认识我了吗。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Ah, that's better. What? You don't recognize me?"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","权力这东西握得太紧，反而容易失去。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Cling too tightly to power and it slips through your fingers."],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","去吧，创造属于你们的时代。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Go on, forge an age that belongs to you."],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","有趣的馈赠！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/en","A most intriguing gift!"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","心意我收下了。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/en","Appreciated."],["/affinity_gift_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","还是转赠给更需要的人吧。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/2/text_i18n/en","You'd better give this to someone in need."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","在这里打个盹吧"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/en","I'll take a nap here..."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","这里的软垫……真舒服啊"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/en","These cushions... they're so soft..."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","唔……好吃！再来一盘！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Delicious! Another plate, please!"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","罗兰狐狸对赛凡纳街头的小吃摊有着极高的鉴赏水平，他常出没的摊位，绝对美味十足。"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/en","Rolan, the little fox, has a discerning taste in Savannah's street food. Any stall it frequents is guaranteed to be delicious."],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","小狐狸的社交圈极广，有很多动物朋友。不仅曾帮人找到过走丢的家养猫，甚至还能指挥王都的流浪狗去警告试图行窃的盗贼。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/en","Rolan has an extensive network of animal friends. Besides helping people find their lost pets, he once rallied a pack of stray dogs to drive off petty thieves."],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","圣堂的秘密档案中记载了第一次神魔大战时的一幕：当女神艾雅面对人间的惨状流下悲悯的眼泪时，罗兰从怀里掏出一块普通的亚麻手帕递给了她，就像安慰一个普通的朋友。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/en","The temple's secret archives recount a significant moment from the First Divine War: when Dura wept at the devastation of the mortal world, Rolan simply offered her his handkerchief, as though comforting an old friend."],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","建国初期，许多臣民都声称得到过大帝鼓励（拍肩膀）。但罗兰本人私下承认过，他只是因为那些人的名字太长太绕口，他根本记不住，所以才用动作掩饰尴尬。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/en","Many cherished the pat on the shoulder King Rolan once gave them, but it was actually nothing more than a cover for his failure to remember their names."],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","罗兰是笑话爱好者，他曾花了很长时间，教高高在上的女神艾雅理解人类那些荒诞的笑话。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/en","Rolan loves a good joke. He once spent hours explaining the punchlines of every absurd joke he had heard to Dura."],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","下城区的孩子们都知道一个秘密——那只会说话的狐狸不仅能听懂人话，甚至还认得文字！"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/en","Every child in the lower district knows one secret: the talking fox not only understands human language but can read as well!"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","罗兰化作小狐狸时，偶尔会冒出一些古怪的旧时代用词。被路人质疑时，它总是甩着尾巴，一本正经地装作是“听老一辈狐狸说的”。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/en","Rolan occasionally blurts out archaic expressions when in fox form. Whenever people give him puzzled looks, he simply flicks his tail and insists he picked them up from the older foxes."],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","历史学家对初代国王终身未婚的原因有上百种浪漫、圣洁或政治的猜测。但实际上，似乎只是因为罗兰嫌麻烦。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/en","Historians have floated countless theories on why King Rolan never married. The truth is, he just thought marriage was too much of a hassle."],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","尽管在赛凡纳游荡，但罗兰对王室的“不干预原则”执行极其严苛。数十年前，赛凡纳曾发生过一次险些波及王室的暴乱，而罗兰只是变成狐狸一边啃着苹果，一边平静地看着下面的人类自己收拾残局。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/en","Rolan never breaks the royal family's rule of staying out of governance—not even during the riot that nearly reached the palace gates. He just watched from the sidelines, apple in hand."],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","赛凡纳的工匠在修缮古老的排水道时，偶尔会发现图纸上写着一些极其精妙的修改批注。那字迹与保存在皇家展览馆里的罗兰手稿一模一样。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/en","While repairing Savannah's ancient sewer system, workers occasionally come across ingenious notes scribbled across the original blueprints. The handwriting is identical to that of Rolan's manuscripts kept in the Royal Museum."],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","以后？以后的安排就留给以后想呗。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/en","What I'll do next? I'll think about that later."],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep7/herohub_story/17411110.json"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/en","locales/en/ep7/herohub_story/17411110.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","小狐狸"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/en","Little Fox"],["/interaction_records/0/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","赛凡纳"],["/interaction_records/0/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Savannah"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","大惊小怪地看着我做什么？难道身份暴露之后，本狐就不能出现在这里了？"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/en","Why are you staring like that? Just because people know who I am now doesn't mean I can't go outside."],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep7/herohub_story/17411130.json"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/en","locales/en/ep7/herohub_story/17411130.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","小狐狸 & 激动的粉丝"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/en","Little Fox & Excited Fan"],["/interaction_records/1/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","赛凡纳"],["/interaction_records/1/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Savannah"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","格温妮丝，你已经盯着我看了十分钟了！"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/en","Gwyneth, you've been staring at me for ten minutes!"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep7/herohub_story/17411150.json"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/en","locales/en/ep7/herohub_story/17411150.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","小狐狸 & 格温妮丝"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/en","Little Fox & Gwyneth"],["/interaction_records/2/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","赛凡纳"],["/interaction_records/2/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Savannah"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","喂，大魔法师，怎么你也在盯着我看了？"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/en","Hey, Magister. Why are you staring now?"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep7/herohub_story/17411160.json"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/en","locales/en/ep7/herohub_story/17411160.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","小狐狸"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/en","Little Fox"],["/interaction_records/3/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","赛凡纳"],["/interaction_records/3/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Savannah"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","呼……这阳光，这微风，这才叫生活嘛。"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/en","Ah... sun on my fur, a nice breeze. This is the life."],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep7/herohub_story/17411180.json"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/en","locales/en/ep7/herohub_story/17411180.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","小狐狸"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/en","Little Fox"],["/interaction_records/4/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","赛凡纳"],["/interaction_records/4/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Savannah"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","不行……还是射得不够准。"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/en","No... still not good enough."],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep7/herohub_story/17411190.json"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/en","locales/en/ep7/herohub_story/17411190.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","格温妮丝 & 小狐狸"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/en","Gwyneth & Little Fox"],["/interaction_records/5/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","赛凡纳"],["/interaction_records/5/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Savannah"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","关于我的窝啊……怎么啦？是不是看着太舒服了，你也想住进去？"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/en","My lair? What about it? Does it look so comfortable that you want to move in too?"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep7/herohub_story/17411250.json"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/en","locales/en/ep7/herohub_story/17411250.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","小狐狸"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/en","Little Fox"],["/interaction_records/6/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","赛凡纳"],["/interaction_records/6/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Savannah"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","呼……呼……呼……"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/en","*Snore*... *Snore*..."],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep7/herohub_story/17411270.json"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/en","locales/en/ep7/herohub_story/17411270.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","小狐狸"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/en","Little Fox"],["/interaction_records/7/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","赛凡纳"],["/interaction_records/7/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Savannah"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","唔……咳咳咳！好奇怪的味道……"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/en","*Cough* That smells awful..."],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep7/herohub_story/17411280.json"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/en","locales/en/ep7/herohub_story/17411280.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","格温妮丝 & 小狐狸"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/en","Gwyneth & Little Fox"],["/interaction_records/8/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","赛凡纳"],["/interaction_records/8/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Savannah"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/cn","哦？又一位伟大的国王陛下，向您致以敬意。"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/en","Oh? Another great king in my presence. My deepest respects, Your Majesty."],["/interaction_records/9/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415770.json"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415770.json"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/cn","沙利叶 & 罗兰"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/en","Ravion & Rolan"],["/interaction_records/10/preview_i18n/cn","在这里打个盹吧"],["/interaction_records/10/preview_i18n/en","I'll take a nap here..."],["/interaction_records/10/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415787.json"],["/interaction_records/10/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415787.json"],["/interaction_records/10/title_i18n/cn","罗兰"],["/interaction_records/10/title_i18n/en","Rolan"],["/interaction_records/11/preview_i18n/cn","唔……好吃！再来一盘！"],["/interaction_records/11/preview_i18n/en","Delicious! Another plate, please!"],["/interaction_records/11/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415788.json"],["/interaction_records/11/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415788.json"],["/interaction_records/11/title_i18n/cn","罗兰"],["/interaction_records/11/title_i18n/en","Rolan"]]}